"""
{{ dag_id }} - Enterprise Data Pipeline

Domain: {{ domain_name }}
Product: {{ product_name }}
Environment: {{ environment }}
Source: {{ source_type }} ({{ source_format }})
Schedule: {{ schedule_interval | default('None (manual)') }}

PIPELINE FLOW:
┌─────────────┐    ┌─────────────┐    ┌─────────────┐    ┌─────────────┐    ┌─────────────┐
│   LANDING   │ →  │   BRONZE    │ →  │   SILVER    │ →  │    GOLD     │ →  │   TRUSTED   │
│  (Validate) │    │  (Ingest)   │    │ (Transform) │    │ (Aggregate) │    │  (Publish)  │
└─────────────┘    └─────────────┘    └─────────────┘    └─────────────┘    └─────────────┘

TASK GROUPS:
1. pre_checks: File sensing, schema validation, contract verification
2. landing_zone: Raw file validation and staging
3. bronze_zone: Raw data ingestion with typing
4. silver_zone: Cleansing, dedup, transformation, DQ checks
5. gold_zone: Aggregation, business metrics
6. trusted_zone: Publication to targets, certification
7. post_processing: Audit logging, notifications, cleanup
8. quality_gate: DQ scoring and gate decisions
9. self_healing: Automatic error recovery

Generated by: Data Agent (Enterprise Template)
Jira: {{ jira_ticket | default('N/A') }}
"""

